        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D0806A Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's modern style single cylinder deadbolt kit has many features which ensure a product of high security. The exterior collars are made of solid forged brass. The 1 inch deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforced strike plate with 3 inch long screws for additional security.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe interiors have large contemporary turnpieces which are both aesthetically pleasing and easy to operate.  Fits a standard 2-1/8\" door prep. Deadbolt kit includes lock cylinder with collar, deadbolt assembly, faceplate, and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D0806A Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Available with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Available for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued</b>. See available <a href=\"/collections/omnia-deadbolts-and-privacy-bolts\"><b>Omnia Deadbolts</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
