                "description": "Omnia D0806A - Omnia's modern style single cylinder deadbolt kit has many features which ensure a product of high security. The exterior collars are made of solid forged brass. The 1 inch deadbolt has saw-proof inserts. It includes an armored reinforced strike plate with 3 inch long screws for additional security.\r\n",
